# Keep the build context small and never ship host build artifacts or secrets.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Secrets / local-only config (Failsafe rule = grade 0 if leaked)
**/.env
!**/.env.example
**/appsettings.Development.json
*.pem
*.key

# VCS / docs / IaC not needed inside the image
.git/
.gitignore
**/*.md
database/
infra/
